THIRD-PARTY NOTICES

This package contains no source code from other software.  It implements
published methods, each cited in the source file that implements it:

* CDF 9/7 filters: A. Cohen, I. Daubechies and J.-C. Feauveau, "Biorthogonal
  bases of compactly supported wavelets", Commun. Pure Appl. Math. 45(5), 1992,
  with the coefficients of JPEG 2000 Part 1 (ISO/IEC 15444-1).
* À trous filtering: M. Holschneider, R. Kronland-Martinet, J. Morlet and
  Ph. Tchamitchian, "A real-time algorithm for signal analysis with the help of
  the wavelet transform", in Wavelets, Time-Frequency Methods and Phase Space,
  Springer, 1989; M. J. Shensa, "The discrete wavelet transform: wedding the à
  trous and Mallat algorithms", IEEE Trans. Signal Process. 40(10), 1992.
